在日常工作中积极的普及全员使用AI. 参考直营店的工作要求:所有向集团侧、事业部级报送的一切邮件、资料、方案、合同一律必须事先发送“AI评估”,连带评估意见一并提报(当然,如果AI评估已经有问题的,建议先自行修订再提报)。我希望咱们区域内的小伙伴也要积极拥抱AI给自己、给团队带来的增效. 并拟于2月份召开一次线上的专题会议,希望每位店总就AI这个维度进行专题的分享,不论是个人的应用体会,还是在日常工作中同事们应用的提效都可以. @所有人 ","task_id":"t135657","tasklists":[],"updated_at":"1769829129694","url":"https://applink.feishu.cn/client/todo/detail?guid=a64c5e26-6391-4a42-9398-08143f74d958&suite_entity_num=t135657"},{"completed_at":"1775108126912","created_at":"1769319423016","creator":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","type":"user"},"dependencies":[],"description":"","extra":"","guid":"35eb3530-0f88-45b0-bcc4-b225fb253d78","is_milestone":false,"members":[{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_3517b63ffe1238e009b7fc4298ab74f9","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_7c159b7dbbeedab2b851f1c8446bc1b5","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_3517b63ffe1238e009b7fc4298ab74f9","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_7c159b7dbbeedab2b851f1c8446bc1b5","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","role":"follower","type":"user"}],"mode":2,"origin":{"href":{"title":"","url":""},"platform_i18n_name":{"de_de":"","en_us":"","es_es":"","fr_fr":"","it_it":"","ja_jp":"","ko_kr":"","ru_ru":"","th_th":"","zh_cn":"","zh_hk":"","zh_tw":""}},"parent_task_guid":"","repeat_rule":"","source":2,"status":"done","subtask_count":0,"summary":"咱们对集团提报70家/周的拜访是没问题的，可以直接嵌入飞书云文档，但是周报以后，三位的外拓计划必须补充到咱们酒店外拓的整体周计划中@孙雪艳  @赵炳涛  @陈雷明  你们三位的外拓不用追求数量！ 要有质量！ 要有大客户开发的思路和方向感出来，至少每个月找到一个为酒店长期增收5-10万的生意机会 ！  不论从线上、线下，竞争对手都行，甚至可以连续1-2个月去蹲守！","task_id":"t135508","tasklists":[],"updated_at":"1775108127188","url":"https://applink.feishu.cn/client/todo/detail?guid=35eb3530-0f88-45b0-bcc4-b225fb253d78&suite_entity_num=t135508"},{"completed_at":"0","created_at":"1768890030583","creator":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","type":"user"},"dependencies":[],"description":"","extra":"","guid":"6a88ba63-ab06-4d52-817f-7a2d25dad253","is_milestone":false,"members":[{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_9c9a96e3db30579a7992b6f6aa3e9b3a","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_030cf497a5d422b7f507c422bb9aca65","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_3517b63ffe1238e009b7fc4298ab74f9","role":"assignee","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_9c9a96e3db30579a7992b6f6aa3e9b3a","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_030cf497a5d422b7f507c422bb9aca65","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_3517b63ffe1238e009b7fc4298ab74f9","role":"follower","type":"user"},{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","role":"follower","type":"user"}],"mode":2,"origin":{"href":{"title":"","url":""},"platform_i18n_name":{"de_de":"","en_us":"","es_es":"","fr_fr":"","it_it":"","ja_jp":"","ko_kr":"","ru_ru":"","th_th":"","zh_cn":"","zh_hk":"","zh_tw":""}},"parent_task_guid":"","repeat_rule":"","source":2,"status":"todo","subtask_count":0,"summary":"@孙雪艳  @赵炳涛  @陈雷明  @李勋  @张惠  @王鑫  @刘东东  @魏安琴  @夏美娟  要求:你们每个人使用“阿里千问”去下单外卖、下单酒店,晚例会提交使用体验反馈,当然可以自行选择退单退货也行.建议是完整体验一下,不体验没感觉,看看阿里AI底层调用了什么APP,这样就提示我们在哪些APP的信息发布上要有优化! 要有更积极、更有特点的展示! 否则,AI不会帮忙客户进行预订. 再要求:你们用美团开发的”小姜AI助手“下单咱们酒店或者周边的酒店,我刚刚试了,可以随时美团后台退掉的. 这样你们再洞察一下美团上我们产品展示有哪些不足,当然,千问是调用的高德地图和飞猪!   要求,你们全部操作一遍! @田静  (@朱雅静  @郑伟  @姜国军  三位也不建议落后)","task_id":"t135256","tasklists":[],"updated_at":"1768890033543","url":"https://applink.feishu.cn/client/todo/detail?guid=6a88ba63-ab06-4d52-817f-7a2d25dad253&suite_entity_num=t135256"},{"completed_at":"0","created_at":"1767497992692","creator":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","type":"user"},"dependencies":[],"description":"","extra":"","guid":"a9507737-6fe9-473e-9455-3f06c45f93a0","is_mi